{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：17:00 2026-10-17 HKT<br/>發佈時間：17:00 2026-10-17 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：17:00 2026-10-17 HKT</p><img alt=\"將軍澳電視城戶外雜物起火 消防趕至救熄\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a941b086b644ecaeb96e84d77c67001c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_16_17_57_1_.jpeg\"/><p>將軍澳駿才街77號TVB電視廣播城，今日（17日）下午近3時有戶外雜物起火。消防接報到場將火救熄，事件中無人受傷。起火原因仍在調查。</p><img alt=\"消防接報趕至撲救。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/32b99ca073663e09840dc35903172a86/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_16_17_55.jpeg\" title=\"消防接報趕至撲救。楊偉亨攝\"/><p>消防接報趕至撲救。楊偉亨攝</p><img alt=\"現場為將軍澳TVB電視城。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/42914a428eb014fc96aff36b4b4e3142/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_16_17_57.jpeg\" title=\"現場為將軍澳TVB電視城。楊偉亨攝\"/><p>現場為將軍澳TVB電視城。楊偉亨攝</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T09:11:52.196301+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":3,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T09:00:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T22:37:57.888550+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T09:10:15.218653+00:00","content_hash":"63a7c29d33f6464639b300a74b85fbb5b75653c4ea9a3c45a3b394040bc81e5c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}